  "policy": "Copied first-party complete encoder control adds optional learned-tree field-role ANS serialization with every legacy prefix bit as a floor. All baseline public bytes, candidate complete-file floors, every original native/Rust sample, closed storage and source/module/report/input/tool/harness pins are required. Five disjoint development processes share one bounded service; runtime remains single-threaded. Field-specific ANS is added only when packed payloads fit uint32, and staged bytes unwind before optional fallback. This is prototype compression/correctness evidence, not production retention or speed proof."
